# Amadeus for Developers API credentials
# Sign up free at: https://developers.amadeus.com
# 1. Create an account and go to "My Apps"
# 2. Create a new app — you get a Client ID and Client Secret
# 3. The free test environment works immediately (sandbox data)
# 4. For live prices, request production access from the same dashboard
#
AMADEUS_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
AMADEUS_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret_here
